	(text "RESET_n: driven by U3 (power-on / warm reset), by the CPU RESET instruction, read by U3;\nalso FPU RESET and LA3. HALT_n: 68030 input only, driven by U3 with RESET.\n1k gives ~5 mA sink at 5 V (CPU IOL 10.7 mA, EC)."
